  "description": "Diacritics are used across many languages in order to change the sound-values of the letters to which they are added. In software development, diacritics often have to be replaced with non-diacritics, e.g. to improve usability of user input. Diacritics.NET is a basic mapper between diacritic characters an non-diacritic characters.",
